   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "originalText": "Green = the shortest-path tree edges (final distances).\nGray = edges that lost or were never needed.\nPop the smallest tentative distance, LOCK it, relax its edges.",
