   "text": "Relaxation: if dist[u] + w < dist[v] then dist[v] = dist[u] + w\nRequires NON-NEGATIVE weights (else greedy lock is unsafe).\nUnreachable vertices stay infinite -> printed as -1.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
